title: "Memex: local-first, zero-LLM agent memory"
abstract: "Memex stores agent-curated records locally and retrieves their original text with stable IDs, correction history, and validity dates. Default MCP recall uses local vector search without a generative LLM. Built by AliceLabs LLC."
